      Updated &lt;time title=&quot;17 September 2026 at 20:36&quot; datetime=&quot;2026-09-17T20:36:57Z&quot;&gt;about 16 hours ago&lt;/time&gt; by &lt;a class=&quot;mw-100 d-inline-block align-bottom text-truncate text-wrap&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; href=&quot;https://www.openstreetmap.org/user/TesseractPi&quot;&gt;TesseractPi&lt;/a&gt;
